WEBVTT

00:07:58.764 --> 00:08:02.435
little by little every day.

00:08:02.435 --> 00:08:04.952
Two and a half years ago,

00:08:04.952 --> 00:08:08.110
Pete was hitting home 
runs at baseball fields.

00:08:08.110 --> 00:08:11.940
Today, Pete's completely paralyzed.

00:08:11.940 --> 00:08:14.306
He can't hold his head up any longer.

00:08:14.306 --> 00:08:16.920
He's confined to a motorized wheelchair.

00:08:16.920 --> 00:08:19.138
He can no longer swallow or eat.

00:08:19.138 --> 00:08:21.033
He has a feeding tube.

00:08:21.033 --> 00:08:23.698
He can't speak.

00:08:25.239 --> 00:08:28.775
He talks with eye gaze technology

00:08:28.775 --> 00:08:30.726
and a speech generating device,